    # 语法
    \e[31mThis text will be red.\e[0m	\\e[31mThis text will be red.\\e[0m
    \e[32mThis text will be green.\e[0m	\\e[32mThis text will be green.\\e[0m
    \e[33mThis text will be yellow.\e[0m	\\e[33mThis text will be yellow.\\e[0m
    \e[34mThis text will be blue.\e[0m	\\e[34mThis text will be blue.\\e[0m
    \e[35mThis text will be magenta.\e[0m	\\e[35mThis text will be magenta.\\e[0m
    \e[36mThis text will be cyan.\e[0m	\\e[36mThis text will be cyan.\\e[0m
    \e[37mThis text will be light gray.\e[0m	\\e[37mThis text will be light gray.\\e[0m

    \e[1;31mThis text will be bold and red.\e[0m	\\e[1;31mThis text will be bold and red.\\e[0m
    \e[5;31mThis text will be bold and red.\e[0m	\\e[5;31mThis text will be bold and red.\\e[0m
    \e[1;5;31mThis text will be bold and red.\e[0m	\\e[1;5;31mThis text will be bold and red.\\e[0m

    颜色编码表如下：

    30: Black (黑色)
    31: Red (红色)
    32: Green (绿色)
    33: Yellow (黄色)
    34: Blue (蓝色)
    35: Magenta (洋红/品红色)
    36: Cyan (青色)
    37: Light gray (浅灰色)
    90: Dark gray (深灰色)
    91: Light red (亮红色)
    92: Light green (亮绿色)
    93: Light yellow (亮黄色)
    94: Light blue (亮蓝色)
    95: Light magenta (亮洋红色)
    96: Light cyan (亮青色)
    97: White (白色)


